더 자세한 예시는 /javascript-very-long에서 확인하세요.

비동기 데이터 처리를 보여주는 JavaScript 예시입니다.

```javascript
class ExpenseRepository {
  constructor() {
    this.expenses = [];
  }

  add(expense) {
    this.expenses.push(expense);
  }

  async summary() {
    return this.expenses.reduce((result, expense) => {
      result[expense.category] = (result[expense.category] || 0) + expense.amount;
      return result;
    }, {});
  }
}

const repository = new ExpenseRepository();
repository.add({ title: "Lunch", category: "Food", amount: 12.5 });
repository.add({ title: "Bus", category: "Transport", amount: 2.0 });
console.log(await repository.summary());
```
